message: If you use this work, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: dataset
title: 'Demonstration of the YANG Topology Emulation in Containernet: Reproduction
  of a Post-Quantum TLS Performance Measurement'
abstract: "This demonstration showcases our Python library\u2019s Containernet backend\
  \ by reproducing a published post-quantum TLS measurement. We reconstructed the\
  \ topology in YANG from the original publication\u2019s text and diagrams. It connects\
  \ a client and server through a bidirectional link, with optical splitters directing\
  \ traffic to a sniffer. The backend instantiates this topology and emulates it with\
  \ the optical splitters. Scripts from the original public artifacts install the\
  \ software dependencies and execute the measurement reported in Table 4a of \u201C\
  The Performance of Post-Quantum TLS 1.3\u201D (DOI: 10.1145/3624354.3630585) by\
  \ Sosnowski et al., presented at CoNEXT\u201923. The table lists median handshake\
  \ latencies for different key encapsulation mechanisms (KEMs) under varying network\
  \ conditions. Finally, the results are evaluated, a CSV file and a PDF plot are\
  \ generated, and the emulation is stopped."
